** End-to-end nonlinear dynamic MPC verification.
** Two planar CR3D cantilever segments are connected through a rigid offset.
** Node 2 is the master; node 3 is the translational slave. The constant
** vertical tip load excites a transient response while c(q)=0 is enforced.

